From 49b044a322b5a87e4f45fb18e73d09d0b204165e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anastasios Gardelis <314907274+adgardelis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 01:49:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(tools): bind persisted results to session capabilities

Route oversized tool outputs through opaque same-session recovery URIs, resolve them before backend path handling, and expose a capability-only Codex MCP reader. Preserve legacy path behavior only for callers without session context.
